╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║  DESCRIPTORY                                                                 ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                                              ║
║  Purpose:         Crawl UK Parliament (Lords + Commons) members 0–999,       ║
║                   gather contact data (email, phone, ministry, career),      ║
║                   download portraits by ministry, and distribute messages    ║
║                   via DKIM-signed SMTP from mail.lauradei.us.                ║
║                                                                              ║
║  Crawl Sources:                                                              ║
║    - https://members.parliament.uk/member/{0..999}/contact                   ║
║    - https://members.parliament.uk/member/{0..999}/career                    ║
║    - https://members.parliament.uk/member/{0..999}/portrait                  ║
║    - https://www.parliament.uk/.../house-of-commons-enquiries-service/...    ║
║                                                                              ║
║  Output:                                                                     ║
║    - contacts.csv       HOL + HOC with "Year of Our Lord" headings           ║
║    - personal/          Outlook-importable CSV (Lords/Ministers only)         ║
║    - portraits/         JPEGs sorted by ministry folder                      ║
║    - sent/              SHA-256 hashed messages + success/failure logs        ║
║                                                                              ║
║  Crawl Policy:    Skip if .last-crawl < 30 days. Re-crawl on new election   ║
║                   season (House of Lords / House of Commons).                ║
║                                                                              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║  SECURITY                                                                    ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║                                                                              ║
║  TLS:             Enforced TLS 1.2+ for all outbound SMTP                    ║
║  DKIM:            2048-bit, Unix socket milter (no inet exposure)             ║
║  SPF:             -all (hard fail)                                            ║
║  DMARC:           p=quarantine; pct=100                                      ║
║  Relay:           reject_unauth_destination (no open relay)                  ║
║  HELO:            Required + validated (reject invalid/non-FQDN)             ║
║  Headers:         Internal IPs stripped via header_checks                    ║
║  Email Input:     RFC 5321 validated, 254-char max, injection-safe           ║
║  Body Encoding:   Dot-stuffed per RFC 5321 §4.5.2                            ║
║  MySQL:           Minimal-privilege user (SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE)               ║
║  Credentials:     .db-credentials chmod 600, .gitignore excluded             ║
║  Keys:            Private 600, keys dir 700, RequireSafeKeys=yes             ║
║  Timeouts:        30s socket timeout on SMTP                                 ║
║  Scripts:         set -euo pipefail, input validation                        ║
║                                                                              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
