║  Domain:          lauradei.us                                                ║
║  From:            contact@lauradei.us                                        ║
║  DKIM Selector:   ae6e66 (2048-bit RSA)                                      ║
║  Target Host:     Japanese VPS (chance/luck install)                         ║
║  Stack:           Postfix + Dovecot + OpenDKIM                               ║
║  Rate Limit:      2s/destination, 2 concurrent connections                   ║
║                                                                              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
